{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07603","headline":"山庄月夜作 · 萧颖士","name":"山庄月夜作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"献书嗟弃置，疲拙归田园。\n且事计然策，将符公冶言。\n桑榆清暮景，鸡犬应遥村。\n蚕罢里闾晏，麦秋田野喧。\n涧声连枕簟，峯势入阶轩。\n未奏东山妓，先倾北海尊。\n陇瓜香早熟，庭果落初繁。\n更惬野人意，农谈朝竟昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧颖士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}